this is a subordinate clause.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.260
That was the main thing I just told you.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.220
That's the main thing.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:50.300
Now, private things, all right?

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.700
بِغَامَةَ يَدَعْتَ إِتَشَرْ عَصَلِي يُعَبِي سَرُيَا

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:56.760
Yeah, what I did to him.

